{"ID":"20250915113110-qgqciu0","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250915113110-qgqciu0","title":"UPL4——Unity 机制可能带来的问题","type":"doc","updated":"20250915195403"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915113111-vj7afbn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915113111-vj7afbn","updated":"20250915195403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 机制可能带来的问题"}]},{"ID":"20250915113428-uhmmdk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915113428-uhmmdk4","updated":"20250915113508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 引擎本身的设计机制或默认行为在某些情况下会导致性能、可维护性或功能性问题。\n这些问题往往是非业务逻辑造成的隐患或小坑，\n我们需要了解这些注意事项，从而避免对我们的性能分析带来干扰"}]},{"ID":"20250915114732-dm8teo6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250915114732-dm8teo6","updated":"20250915195403"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915114733-jwk040j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915114733-jwk040j","updated":"20250915114946"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915114733-u3vuug5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915114733-u3vuug5","updated":"20250915114946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250915114946-63vsa4f","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"脚本挂载问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915114804-3p9vrkm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915114804-3p9vrkm","updated":"20250915194155"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915114804-eqa41mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915114804-eqa41mq","updated":"20250915194155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250915194154-ylyweu7","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"生命周期函数的问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915114811-ywesyhe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250915114811-ywesyhe","updated":"20250915194420"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915114811-05c2zpp","Type":"NodeP